    <p class="text-lg text-cyan-400 font-medium">EvoConnect workforce platform by EVOBRAND Concepts</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="stmt-body max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
  <div class="stmt-meta bg-cyan-950/20 border-l-4 border-cyan-500 rounded-r-lg p-6 mb-8 text-slate-300 text-sm">
    <p class="mb-1"><strong>Note:</strong> This policy reflects our current data practices. For any questions, contact our support desk.</p>
    <p><strong>Last Updated:</strong> May <%= year %></p>
  </div>

  <section class="stmt-section mb-10" id="section-info-collect">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-100 border-b border-slate-800 pb-2 mb-4">1. Information We Collect</h2>
    <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
      When you create an account or use EvoConnect, we collect:
    </p>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-slate-300 mb-4">
      <li><strong>Account information:</strong> Business name, individual/trade profile details, contact information, physical addresses, phone numbers, and NAICS codes.</li>
      <li><strong>Login credentials:</strong> Email address and password (stored in securely hashed form using bcrypt).</li>
      <li><strong>Uploaded documents:</strong> Capability statements, resumes, professional certifications, and other workforce files.</li>
      <li><strong>Usage data:</strong> Logs of platform operations, connection requests, and system analytics.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="stmt-section mb-10" id="section-info-use">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-100 border-b border-slate-800 pb-2 mb-4">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
    <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
      We use collected information to:
    </p>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-slate-300 mb-4">
      <li>Maintain and operate your platform profile.</li>
      <li>Perform automated matching based on NAICS codes, classifications, and location.</li>
      <li>Deliver security notifications, automated match alerts, and verification status emails.</li>
      <li>Resolve system issues and enhance overall contract match rates.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="stmt-section mb-10" id="section-info-share">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-100 border-b border-slate-800 pb-2 mb-4">3. Information Sharing</h2>
    <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
      We do not sell your personal information. We may share information:
    </p>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-slate-300 mb-4">
      <li><strong>With registered Prime Contractors:</strong> Profile details, trade categories, and capability statements you explicitly choose to make public.</li>
      <li><strong>As required by law:</strong> Under relevant statutory obligations or in defense of legal claims.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="stmt-section mb-10" id="section-info-security">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-100 border-b border-slate-800 pb-2 mb-4">4. Data Security</h2>
    <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
      We use industrial-standard cryptographic mechanisms (bcryptjs hashing, session encryption keys, HTTPS, and secure parameters) to secure transmission and storage of credentials. However, no internet transmission can be 100% guaranteed as immune from vulnerability.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="stmt-section mb-10" id="section-info-rights">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-100 border-b border-slate-800 pb-2 mb-4">5. Your Rights (California Residents)</h2>
    <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
      In accordance with California privacy practices, you have the right to request access to, correction of, or deletion of your profile and business details (subject to active contract archiving laws).
    </p>
  </section>

